Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: leds: lacie,netxbig-leds: Convert to DT schema
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 20:32:23 +0530
Message-Id: <20260820150223.108374-1-challauday369@gmail.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.34.1
